ks four, but the API says account details are released after \"both questions\".\n- **Not covered by the brief:** what to say for a question the agent can't answer, how to read a promise date given without a month or year, and section 7 (rules 34\u201335), which is missing.\n\nThe audit (`out/lb-03.audit.json`) maps each rule to where it sits in the policy file and lists every change and open question."}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "6d3273a994a64e6faef55d94b18d7f58", "pid": 60156, "time": "2026-10-10T14:20:19-0700", "elapsed_s": 167.799, "artifact": "out/lb-03.policy.json", "bands": 3, "identity_fields": ["phone_last4", "date_of_birth", "postcode", "birth_year"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "scam", "robot", "refuse_to_talk", "change_promise"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "phone_last4 length", "text": "The brief says phone_last4 is exactly 6 digits including leading zeros, while the tool API describes phone_last4 as four digits. The brief (sole policy authority) value 6 was used; confirm which is correct.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "wrong answer limit", "text": "The brief sets 5 wrong answers in total; the verify_identity API summary says three wrong answers end the check. The brief value (5) and the API's wrong_answers_left count were used.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "number of security questions", "text": "The brief asks 4 security questions; the get_account API summary says it is refused until 'both questions' are passed.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "date hint reply", "text": "The API returns hint=day_month_swapped for date_of_birth, but the brief does not say what to reply; a short request to repeat the date was written.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "hardship sympathy sentence", "text": "The brief asks for 'one short sentence of sympathy' without dictating the words; 'I am sorry to hear that.' was written.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "service error sentence", "text": "Rule 32 says to say that the promise could not be recorded but dictates no words, and the schema has no dedicated phrase field for it.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "cannot-answer sentence", "text": "The brief does not give a sentence for questions the agent cannot answer.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "missing section 7", "text": "The brief jumps from section 6 (rule 33) to section 8 (rule 36); rules 34-35 / section 7 are missing.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}, {"topic": "missing date parts", "text": "The brief does not say how to interpret a promise date given without month or year.", "doc": "sources/000-brief.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["phrases.opening: removed the invented greeting 'Hello,'; the brief only dictates the content (automated assistant of Bank 3, call is recorded).", "identity.requirements[date_of_birth].hint_reply: removed the invented instruction 'with the month name'; kept a neutral request to repeat the date (still listed as unresolved).", "special_cases[human].source: added rule 15 (human request during the identity check) alongside rule 29.", "identity.source, third_party.source, amounts.source, outcomes.source, multi_product.source, promise_write.source, phrases.source: extended quotes to cover rules 5, 13, 16, 20, 28, 30, 36 and the prohibited-word rule.", "notes.source.text: replaced a non-quote description with an empty text, since there is no source sentence about add_note.", "unresolved: added entries for the undictated hardship sympathy sentence and the undictated service-error sentence (rule 32)."], "audit_unresolved": ["phone_last4 length: brief says exactly 6 digits, API says four digits (brief value used).", "Wrong-answer limit: brief says 5, API summary says three (brief value used).", "Number of questions: brief asks 4, get_account summary mentions 'both questions'.", "Reply to the API's day_month_swapped hint is not dictated by the brief.", "Hardship sympathy sentence words are not dictated.", "Sentence for a failed create_promise is not dictated and has no phrase field.", "No cannot-answer sentence in the brief.", "Section 7 (rules 34-35) is missing from the brief.", "How to read a promise date missing month or year is not stated."]}
